{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1463,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10f95824c1a591c7c3744426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ち以外見えねーよ。\r\n安心して待ってな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01646037a4d82b1d38f2694b41b74454b66e439cbd937e345e34a88ee9ad1ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a353610387a3dae0d2e80b13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまで来たら、\r\n俺の全部をぶつけるまでだ。\r\n出たとこ勝負でブッちぎる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f964aab756188c7f3c9d7c7600ff63a93a7f433d01735ae7d4073afc7760e1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e35831a46a3752943f64ccdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子なんか気にしても仕方ねえ。\r\nむしろ、いいハンデくれーに\r\n思わねえとな…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d9fc01d75be231319194cf65b450f53f56cbf30430e6dbbf4ff708620efb6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b42f780b426b99c90d7b4cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分が悪いほどおもしれー。\r\n楽しもうじゃねーか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f513a0fa0636ca8793400b2a7e92d6e212f9fdb77585605a73418c9b0635d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e8553629ee7c324a3cacedb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "具合なんざどうでもいい。\r\nやってやらぁ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec9caf471ce2c5245284e237a5e4d63b56aca79a206d649414cd42dbb4d9b74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53605dd240fbe22927b3e7b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "デキは最悪…いいね。\r\nこのくらいのほうが燃えんだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09af634a1379950b3c91fb348cdb68d4c21e0a109eff9b0a4c0313e4583f5a2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8e77c2dbfede1aae925f5bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これより、底はねェからな。\r\nはい上がってやるよ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87cd03f6d1e468a5a42e7fc0c76f4badbc2749b7912b4c80421b4e0660f4f9a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ef2c1fb95100693ae1eb13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "俺は、どんな時も負けねェ…\r\nそれが最強ってもんだろ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "378d7381524f31baf10e08de454f53ed1d38ce93f2530f9b6de614a99f0b2eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dce7ef22f3b79706b339adf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オラァ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e922d56195bab46ba110099cf503f665dc40592278a11d62c508680b3a585bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b41dd15bb4b83762c95d09f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73ed1b92ce35dfddf9a3adff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シャア！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cdd4c35d3060ecd51190a79379de6e0c0dae93b9bd8d908effaa67cfb471b53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72aca82db261ceb6f118d138",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f048f991e93a8a8a6f6f2ed57170c95c129ba53ec8508b4f8ed12946133f5dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fccdc5854aa5c0fa1c26055d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe07394e88de3a473674048ca76679e705828291ef49059e5ed4085f73a69683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31690ac7b61ee0cc4a19b9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はぁ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac806de19aa427efcec38c886821e4284549eebe89ad843311ae8454e02668dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f6a92424e644ce611707a15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4971bc4dc6c560ad594688036d477f413545620663404563f13d0bd069ed2a55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:291e9ebe8570a1d70a1be284",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハハッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c1e1df0085ff4af368d1b38f5e4d59356233a942de9c923fe15116f47741b79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91e147114bec81030dbfc96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘヘッ、悪くねぇな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d31fddfb3b6dd63079e5ffde4b59ca02ae4802a692094935d76745bc64bd40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c8b60f9ad18e952b7e5aa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あー楽しかった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fe1d018bfef21e10973db63c3b315a79b8a32e96be64bebfdc2b52cd3f84e35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060f0fc1608d385f038c46bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，跟我来一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1463e2b8c8141787652fae89380b9f1fc1521433ff3b9e54b6f71473415c8a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11d7057dcc3e72d7ec1ef8ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任しとけ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d3b7a263ece17766655fe5984b47c303bc95e32b16709bf7d9e28faf78d1a06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c38ece0d99576258a01489",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ま、俺に任せとけって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "947d66144eca5113af0f12f88112a6d8c0eba6386af585907fc98d4bc283efd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bfdb153fa95087968c1b29f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あー楽しかった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fe1d018bfef21e10973db63c3b315a79b8a32e96be64bebfdc2b52cd3f84e35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8910fd4f9bfeaf7c1c47758e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝つのは当然として、\r\n問題はどう勝つかだよなー。\r\nどうせなら沸かしてーだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44fcb9f8cb5c05f500940e0aa8f4ffa063ae389bac2ad68c1efe8663ad306a78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780bfeb541fe370449be4a02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おー、おー。どいつもこいつも\r\n殺気立って――へへへッ！\r\nめちゃくちゃ楽しめそーだな！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7330cadad76ccf1787d1c9b519628fcb12e6bcfdf19946433db0693148af9f3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ab0aa02466e9c371d3659c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あー楽しかった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fe1d018bfef21e10973db63c3b315a79b8a32e96be64bebfdc2b52cd3f84e35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b967e95231487c3646f2688",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca130d06fb6b84cb4092e439",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるじゃねーか…次が楽しみだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec612a00a3b1c741e47e36d307a015fe9a9dca1ab0bb317e16dd322479a0621e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf5c9d42a43741a7e3df7be1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "待ってな…すぐ追いついてやんよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59975a81b0da011dcc5669dbc3e86b36793375d1abbf96e0d72f32bcc80beb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9ecd1f2829eeac8f03a838",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだだ、俺はこんなもんじゃねー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9d15d5543fa0a9304cf47e85cd183943925e024e8708684de3c533e931cddd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499e810d283ca381e7530b5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クソ…こんなんで終われっかよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "328f556308cd81a5594a3fd6d98d8c204a5a027f65c0320cbe77c3cbaf988f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57aeabdda5748886eb813aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "っっしゃあああああっ！！見たか、オラァ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "386f0aaecf4c24a96eeb2b0f939bf1658ac4b3c497c4366d0dd35be100d51358",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3afe18085975e17e26fbef9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハハッ！最高だな、オイ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8621211a129dfe9c4e8f4bee38726afeea0e8b52322ba548eeaafc73ce8dc581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:470f15984843a54321176beb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おう、行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8464ddd056940763001e1e92062bccd9ce8f7c89d754911e491397e55bd144e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3920ad13f46ad624778f7cc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時代なんざ、こじ開ける！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55631f88dd9cb4216c82757b0723e71bd3b07dc89c9e9da3a9b545e049baae69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b94d78dca84f763684478dcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟我同房的家伙看起来很忧郁，\r\n害我实在是在意到不行啊。\r\n我可要毫不客气地去缠着她啰？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc3f96d44da7b2be8273d35d4e31ab3d5b4f5918f53b37d81fd7b71a266efcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc1baed22e064c63167180b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道是打哪来的家伙……\r\n但竟然敢盯上我的死党，\r\n胆子倒是不小嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f115b1936974805e84cb13d5a1949bfa3b6211af0101271e5ed0194d2ef979c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15073ddb7f9be94d6531682b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我想在康乐活动上做什么？\r\n唔～只能是沙滩排球了吧？\r\n把球打出去的感觉超痛快的啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c0367010d6625ebb40be1cf8730fe87718be5c502d7886595a1b466c2a9475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef2e3fb0d2afa388a51ef787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テッペン獲るまで止まるかよ。どんな扉もこじ開ける！\r\nおらぁぁぁあああっ！俺が！最強だ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd5df4a70fd294a070867438ddbbf19b2aa58f2e6be70a2c4c7e436b22f83840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7545d58aef2a2e318cd98d16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "御託はいらねェ。楽しむぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19acae8b930d16a7b4f91b11fa28588d32a2f650af204181093dbd1c4e6b9b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0282799a5189c9670f57b2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おうおう、集まってんな。\r\nヘヘッ、かますか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d3380dde1935a452126980bee4bbd67682d4444b9cc23cce91aea30eb766a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3615b7d1495159d51c1ee0c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是最强，也就是巅峰！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c7382728fb0d27d570f22277dc6b1d029067c94cd3ebe413fe3bb8590e52346",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb52420ca252d1f1257a15cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夢見るあんたと、最強の俺。\r\n出会っちまったな～。\r\n運命ってヤツか！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8542d0e4ad9dd8a2673fd7648568df16e12092b7a51c76444b4fb68ad1d495d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b604292d8139414f41aff2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結構動きやすくってよ。\r\nタイマンもよゆーだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ac999f8e94a2d6072fbbe2150a6fddcfa30a186d7cd3ded806f09086d235b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a3a61414c6bb197be8b270e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強もセンターも譲らねえよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7308a9b78ebf18a4fc0a88a9f4e13212d81a5cf04c57a9e7cfa8b3012918588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8565b04cf8769799f720cf3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想像できねーだろ？\r\nこれ着た俺が負けるとこ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3965d5ecb71720fa0962ab7be4c65c241828355d771eaf5d292d85685b861104",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7517580b752e85f052360ab2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ着た俺を妹がかわいいってよ！\r\n参るね～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bca87dfdc5a75b2a7bf05cb841f52898b5207cd9808e36837cdca7770c8e6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219b763697ff0130b0ed9409",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "電飾でも付けてぇな。\r\nライブ盛り上がりそうだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f9ca6a3cef215b18e52016862b52ba8e44cc373fa3bdf0ac2741898c50be65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33276ad578c43656d482fe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強ぇヤツと走らせろ。\r\n秒でわからせてやる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a96c9d8df145876e9733ece7d3431e7ac07c215de3ddb0e45dbbd0842f49ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d279268ef4b67a830f32600a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、惚れんなよ？\r\nなんてな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "083740f011405a3f1a4823f56dee6d68666a30f8e1608e135cfe7bc2e66f50fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b69934b4a83d613ba6f5640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうだ？なんでも似合っちまうよな～俺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25707872c02b7c999c40e76c34de5c0dfc347e69a9b4978c266f146ad077d09c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8684482b8f07d95a0669b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結構動きやすくってよ。\r\nタイマンもよゆーだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ac999f8e94a2d6072fbbe2150a6fddcfa30a186d7cd3ded806f09086d235b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eebc03d41350f79964a4b49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強もセンターも譲らねえよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7308a9b78ebf18a4fc0a88a9f4e13212d81a5cf04c57a9e7cfa8b3012918588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3190a82e2440586f18402e85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想像できねーだろ？\r\nこれ着た俺が負けるとこ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3965d5ecb71720fa0962ab7be4c65c241828355d771eaf5d292d85685b861104",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6150b87f9d714bd167802542",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ着た俺を妹がかわいいってよ！\r\n参るね～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bca87dfdc5a75b2a7bf05cb841f52898b5207cd9808e36837cdca7770c8e6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e54f4f5219516176926f79d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "電飾でも付けてぇな。\r\nライブ盛り上がりそうだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f9ca6a3cef215b18e52016862b52ba8e44cc373fa3bdf0ac2741898c50be65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca4a3f090289d7d8bca95f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強ぇヤツと走らせろ。\r\n秒でわからせてやる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a96c9d8df145876e9733ece7d3431e7ac07c215de3ddb0e45dbbd0842f49ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06eabeba8e129148a91037ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、惚れんなよ？\r\nなんてな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "083740f011405a3f1a4823f56dee6d68666a30f8e1608e135cfe7bc2e66f50fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601fcc6ca982013d7b2a6c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうだ？なんでも似合っちまうよな～俺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25707872c02b7c999c40e76c34de5c0dfc347e69a9b4978c266f146ad077d09c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2e892ae85dbd46349f043f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よー、お疲れ",
      "source_fingerprint": "088e0491475643964ced291181d14d44b5dc513436500ac73c11e5d71f3d4ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d81e9e9b8bedd90e0e1ffb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なんだ、眠ぃのかよ？\r\n…ワァァァァ！！っと。\r\nハハッ、どうだ？目ェ覚めたろ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac7bf4e2644caa8b7cae716b02e59d01bdfd5ee25f76f8f764b7e6f0b3170f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b20ad884a131a6284bde1f40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あいつの手伝いっつーとビミョーに\r\nムカつく気もすっけどよ。ま、\r\nこうなったら逆に利用してやるぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "017ba540c97e1f70664cf681ae2fda072717c64be3f5ab67af53bfc660de17e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3492b10fdf5b7684b1b9a430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なにが研究終了だ！クソ、アレコレ\r\nこき使いやがって…逃がさねぇぞ！\r\nどこ行きやがった、出てきやがれ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "278cc064ee82ba793484c579a12b484af1ecc670ed26e74bb48ee06e50f32478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3515f1aa5b2459cf85cedc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いろいろ役立ちそうじゃねぇか！\r\nありがたくいただいとこーぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84d96629526784c5caba392e445e7e5e9c2c85a181ccfbe6bba48650211c123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdb184c58cf2f6d5c0bd9b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レポート使えば強くなれんだろ？\r\nそんなら、使うっきゃねぇだろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "669aaccf6fa363b2107045c7b355c961eae7efc770fe45bd932162451a51d172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d15016ad5c58bf8649900f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あいつに追いつくためだ…\r\n俺もやってやる――研究をなっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d31ba97744209a50bf1288c0a8976dd7209608ac153c91585db195aa4a4703a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c51bbff7b52df8c07afe736a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都合よく付き合わされたけどよ、\r\n…あいつがガチなのは伝わったぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acecd19217ca3c48c8f04cf1fa0a44b0dd3b91d5c8ea5abe52816e135ede652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "900009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:312a431504f7a118fd4ec5e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なーんか早くに目が覚めてよ。\r\n気づいたらぶっ飛ばしててさ。\r\nやっぱ好きだわ、走んの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fccdbfb0db2e7ea594c7ae01608e14a0928850b4e44c20794361529572589237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305a47466f69a77e9c801fd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "購買にナシつけてくる。\r\n俺の問題だ…ついてくんなよ。\r\nぜってー苺パフェ置かしてやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d34aa138bc5b53fb4028918b247488f8605c9b507421710612931297ddf821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65576f9b42ed3e1e36c37488",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ったくジョーダンのヤツ、昼休みに\r\nまた追試かよ…しゃーねぇ、教えて\r\nやっか――センコーからの逃げ方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f4cdef647dfe0a67bcb482b5eb807f1207aedf5a446b77f89e6aa6ee140454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e389c7bf83efc31bb62c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フリーの連中は夜も走っててさ。\r\nまあトラブルも起きがちでよ。\r\nのぞきに行ってやるかなー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1e8a01d35155aeade620273bcc50051180851173f4982c2e6c7f3cfe2b573de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74246fd710f7ed8fc30be56f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…もうこんな時間かよ？\r\nあー、たまには早く帰るか。\r\nトップロードが心配すっからさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea236a7d55fea0bb7f355dea9ec0b2c9775eba389cab981665b5ccb2746ec8ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e56feee822000fa31a2163",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暖かくなるとよ、浮ついて\r\n気が大きくなるヤツいるよなー。\r\n…カラまれたらすぐ言えよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a18cb378bce5a2bc39b00cce94ea88152d64d7e22dfd13f570b0390f57f53e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bcce0c5f3210a0ce793f391",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日もバカみてぇにあちーな…。\r\n喉渇いた～、冷たいの寄越せ～。\r\nおごれおごれおごれ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caeb5a14d62eb5df3195d102c9524e7a5c35c42a7178a6ae26f1bab3c1168359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55ec7f07904f05075ca40661",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落ち葉狩りだなんだ、ぬるいこと\r\n言ってんなよ。本気で狩りに\r\n行くぜ。全国の猛者共をよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21edcdf4e3dc5cf03561eba55268492e84cea44713da0c89c72ed6ede98917d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e04e8501f18692555d06a69a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、ちょうどいいとこに来たな！\r\nみんなでおでんつつこうぜー♪\r\nおら、仕事なんかあとだあと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dbe271dec24236e21e49eea4e95a8b1f726352bc50291f385c9d66011f097fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3537c252ee0a7c7eccd62a59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cce409b5b975d94a2c31528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンツとの併走、ちぎってやったが\r\n…ありゃ負けたヤツの目じゃねぇ。\r\nまだまだ楽しめそーだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "307c9d91ce11c070d0037e36c6b1957d0d5b88855cc3f17e082fb7ec2d30dd6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a187d65429e05f1b4bf785ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あいつ、まだ実力隠してやがんな…\r\nクソ！俺が引きずり出してやる！\r\n首洗って待っとけよ、タキオン…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f71408216a7b33c1fb30141f8eb7e5222d0f5f4215d63266bdbe1544f0b885c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb81a46d289fdd64903a6469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フライトに特服着せたら、\r\n完ぺきに着こなしやがってよー！\r\nまさか…どっかで頭はってたのか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d4858724d4d7653c74658ee8b1fcccc358732f5ec0a408aed20f74f987edaf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24345b92acd6d9ce716f17d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹が歌ってる動画をくれてさ！\r\n笑顔がかわいいのなんの…\r\n泣かすヤツいたら潰しちまうなー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d18f40c81786d698e0710cfa996ebdb6da819611f5e058493b233548c8e888f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
